---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — KitnaSIP" description="How KitnaSIP handles your data." path="/privacy">
  <section class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-IN', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</em></p>

    <p>
      KitnaSIP is designed to respect your privacy. This page explains, in plain language, what data
      is and isn't collected. <strong>Please review this with your own advisers before publishing —
      it's a starting template, not legal advice.</strong>
    </p>

    <h2>The calculator</h2>
    <p>
      Everything you type into the KitnaSIP calculator — income, expenses, goal, and so on — is
      processed <strong>entirely in your browser</strong>. Those figures are not sent to us or stored
      on any server. Refreshing the page clears them.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics to understand aggregate, anonymous usage (which pages are visited, from
      which country, on what kind of device). This helps us improve the site. It does not identify you
      personally. You can block it with any standard ad/tracker blocker.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      We may show display advertising (e.g. Google AdSense). Ad networks may use cookies to serve
      relevant ads; you can manage ad personalisation through your Google account settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
    <p>
      Some outbound links (for example, to open a demat account) may be affiliate links. If you use
      one and sign up, we may receive a fixed referral fee at no extra cost to you. This never affects
      what the calculator shows.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about privacy? Reach us via the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <p style="color:var(--text-tertiary);font-size:0.85rem">This policy applies to {SITE.url}.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
